  "body": "Experience the pinnacle of luxury at Kauri Residences, stunning apartments in the heart of Browns Bay on Auckland's North Shore. Just 300 metres from the beach, this is an opportunity you won't want to miss. A brilliant downsize option or a lock up and leave for those wanting an easy care, no maintenance lifestyle.\r\n\r\nApartment 306 is a standout, located on the third floor with beautiful west facing deck to catch all afternoon sun. This immaculate one-bedroom apartment boasts high ceilings and a seamless blend of comfort and style. Quiet and private located back from the road.\r\n\r\nStart your day with a relaxing walk on Browns Bay beach, grab a coffee from a nearby café, and enjoy the convenience of having everything within reach. In the evening, unwind on your private deck, savouring the beautiful sunsets with your favourite drink.\r\nKauri Residences is more than a home, it's a showcase of exceptional design and luxury. Perfect for those seeking a stylish, low-maintenance lifestyle, this boutique development redefines luxury living in Browns Bay.\r\n\r\nSelling by way of a deadline sale, get your offer in for the chance to secure this great apartment.\r\n\r\nTo download the property files please visit:- https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FF7X",
